{
  "name": "WF-6 - Shift Completion + Pay Record",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF-6 — Shift Completion + Pay Record\n\n**Webhook:** POST /webhook/shift-complete\n\n**Payload from app:**\n```\n{\n  job_id: UUID,\n  cleaner_id: UUID,\n  supervisor_id: UUID\n}\n```\n\n**What this workflow does:**\n\n**Branch A (top):** Checks if ALL job_zones for this job have status = 'completed'. If yes, updates jobs.status → 'completed'.\n\n**Branch B (bottom):** Looks up the active facility hourly rate + cleaner's contracted_hours, inserts a pay_record row, then inserts a supervisor notification.\n\n**⚠️ Prerequisites before testing:**\n- facility_rates must have at least one row for this facility with role_type = 'cleaner' and effective_from in the past\n- profiles.contracted_hours must be set for the cleaner (default 8.0)\n- gross_pay is NOT inserted (it is computed separately or left null)",
        "height": 500,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0006-0000-000000000001",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-320, 20]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "shift-complete",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0006-0000-000000000002",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [260, 300],
      "webhookId": "b1c2d3e4-f5a6-7890-bcde-f01234567802"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "tableId": "jobs",
        "returnAll": true,
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "id",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $json.body.job_id }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0006-0000-000000000003",
      "name": "Get Job Details",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [500, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "qqH4brGQ87PpjkK5",
          "name": "Supabase account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "tableId": "job_zones",
        "returnAll": true,
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "job_id",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.job_id }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0006-0000-000000000004",
      "name": "Get All Job Zones",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [740, 100],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "qqH4brGQ87PpjkK5",
          "name": "Supabase account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const zones = $input.all().map(i => i.json);\nconst active = zones.filter(z => z.status !== 'deleted');\nif (active.length === 0) {\n  return [{ json: { all_complete: false } }];\n}\nconst allComplete = active.every(z => z.status === 'completed');\nreturn [{ json: { all_complete: allComplete } }];",
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems"
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0006-0000-000000000005",
      "name": "Check All Zones Complete",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [980, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "all-zones-cond-01",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.all_complete }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0006-0000-000000000006",
      "name": "All Zones Done?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1220, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "tableId": "jobs",
        "filterType": "manual",
        "matchType": "allFilters",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "id",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.job_id }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "dataToSend": "defineBelow",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            {
              "fieldId": "status",
              "fieldValue": "completed"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0006-0000-000000000007",
      "name": "Update Job Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1460, 100],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "qqH4brGQ87PpjkK5",
          "name": "Supabase account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "tableId": "facility_rates",
        "returnAll": true,
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "facility_id",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $('Get Job Details').item.json.facility_id }}"
            },
            {
              "keyName": "role_type",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "cleaner"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0006-0000-000000000008",
      "name": "Get Facility Rates",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [740, 500],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "qqH4brGQ87PpjkK5",
          "name": "Supabase account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const rates = $input.all().map(i => i.json);\nconst today = new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0];\n\nconst activeRates = rates\n  .filter(r => r.effective_from <= today)\n  .sort((a, b) => b.effective_from.localeCompare(a.effective_from));\n\nif (activeRates.length === 0) {\n  throw new Error('No active facility rate found. Seed the facility_rates table with at least one row (role_type=cleaner, effective_from in the past).');\n}\n\nconst rate = activeRates[0];\nconst job = $('Get Job Details').first().json;\nconst webhook = $('Webhook').first().json;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    hourly_rate: Number(rate.hourly_rate),\n    job_id: webhook.body.job_id,\n    cleaner_id: webhook.body.cleaner_id,\n    supervisor_id: webhook.body.supervisor_id,\n    facility_id: job.facility_id,\n    shift_date: job.scheduled_date,\n    company_id: job.company_id\n  }\n}];",
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems"
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0006-0000-000000000009",
      "name": "Pick Active Rate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [980, 500]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "tableId": "profiles",
        "returnAll": true,
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "id",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.cleaner_id }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0006-0000-000000000010",
      "name": "Get Cleaner Profile",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1220, 500],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "qqH4brGQ87PpjkK5",
          "name": "Supabase account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const payData = $('Pick Active Rate').first().json;\nconst cleaner = $input.first().json;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    cleaner_id: payData.cleaner_id,\n    supervisor_id: payData.supervisor_id,\n    company_id: payData.company_id,\n    facility_id: payData.facility_id,\n    job_id: payData.job_id,\n    shift_date: payData.shift_date,\n    hours_worked: Number(cleaner.contracted_hours ?? 8.0),\n    hourly_rate: payData.hourly_rate,\n    role_type: 'cleaner',\n    is_replacement: false,\n    status: 'draft',\n    _cleaner_name: cleaner.full_name ?? 'Cleaner'\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0006-0000-000000000011",
      "name": "Build Pay Record",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1460, 500]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://bstohwxzufebufbybxtd.supabase.co/rest/v1/pay_records?on_conflict=cleaner_id,job_id",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "supabaseApi",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Prefer", "value": "resolution=merge-duplicates,return=representation" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ cleaner_id: $json.cleaner_id, supervisor_id: $json.supervisor_id, company_id: $json.company_id, facility_id: $json.facility_id, job_id: $json.job_id, shift_date: $json.shift_date, hours_worked: $json.hours_worked, hourly_rate: $json.hourly_rate, role_type: $json.role_type, is_replacement: $json.is_replacement, status: $json.status }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0006-0000-000000000012",
      "name": "Insert Pay Record",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1700, 500],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "qqH4brGQ87PpjkK5",
          "name": "Supabase account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "create",
        "tableId": "notifications",
        "dataToSend": "defineBelow",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            { "fieldId": "user_id",  "fieldValue": "={{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.supervisor_id }}" },
            { "fieldId": "title",    "fieldValue": "Shift completed" },
            { "fieldId": "message",  "fieldValue": "={{ 'Shift completed and pay record created for ' + $('Build Pay Record').item.json._cleaner_name }}" },
            { "fieldId": "is_read",  "fieldValue": "=false" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0006-0000-000000000013",
      "name": "Insert Supervisor Notification",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1940, 500],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "qqH4brGQ87PpjkK5",
          "name": "Supabase account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
